'''Natorian''' "'''Duece'''" '''Watts''' (born December 23, 1999) is an American professional [[American football|football]] [[wide receiver]]. He played [[college football]] for the [[Jones County Junior College|Jones College Bobcats]] and [[Tulane Green Wave football|Tulane Green Wave]].
